  "description": "Carrera – The Ultimate Balance of Ride Quality, Power, and Versatility\nThe Carrera Tandem strikes the perfect balance of ride quality, power, and versatility, making it the ideal bike for riders who demand the best of both worlds. With exclusive Reynolds 631 air-hardening steel tubing and the Co-Motion T390 carbon disc fork, the Carrera offers lightweight performance, strength, and comfort. Whether you’re going for a long ride or tackling challenging terrain, this tandem delivers the ultimate in power transfer and smooth handling.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels with 28-32mm tires for a fast, smooth ride\n\nExclusive Reynolds air-hardening 631 steel tubing for a lightweight and durable frame\n\nTapered head tube & matching Co-Motion carbon disc fork for precise handling and control\n\nRack and fender mounts for added convenience and utility on long rides\n\nDual disc brakes for superior stopping power in all conditions\n\nShimano Ultegra drivetrain for smooth, reliable shifting\n\nGates Carbon Drive timing belt for low-maintenance, smooth power transfer\n\nRolf Prima tandem disc wheelset for durability and strength on long tours\n\nInternal Di2 wiring ports for a clean, modern setup\n\nChoose from Shimano or SRAM eTap for wireless electronic shifting, taking your ride to the next level of precision and performance. The Carrera Tandem is built to tackle any terrain with efficiency and style, offering exceptional versatility for riders who demand the best.\n\nComplete bike starting at $8,995.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Carrera\norder started!",
